WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:12.111
Marketing is where you plan campaigns, keep your brand voice in one place, and let AI do the writing. In this video, you’ll look at campaigns, plan a campaign’s posts, and set your brand voice.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.595
Open Marketing. Campaigns are planned, live or ended, from their dates.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:25.713
A campaign has a goal, dates, locations, channels, a budget, a promo code, and a link tag, with all its posts in one place.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:36.321
Plan posts with AI drafts the campaign’s posts across its dates, for you to check, change and schedule. Nothing goes out until you, or your approver, say so.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:47.135
In Marketing, Brand and settings is what AI reads every time it writes for you: what you sell, who your customers are, your tone, and the words to use and avoid.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:53.765
Want a second pair of eyes? Turn on approvals, and choose who approves. Nothing goes out that wasn’t approved.

00:00:54.533 --> 00:01:05.413
Each campaign’s link tag goes on its posts, so you can see which campaigns bring visits to your website. And SEO and website, the next tab, shows how people find you on Google.

